{"v":4,"catch":"本作是日本網絡初期流行的JRPG的重製版。\n戰鬥是在一個立體像素狀的場地中進行的。","desc":"【遊戲】\n這是一款JRPG遊戲，在3D畫面渲染的戰場上進行戰鬥。\n在戰鬥中，角色的位置很重要，他們的魔力會受到所站位置的影響，還可以保護其他朋友。\n每個角色都有LP(Life Point)和MC(Magic Capacity)，通過消耗MC來使用魔法。連續的武器攻擊會恢復更多的MC。\n魔法可以通過使用Ability Point，選擇自己想要的東西來學習。\n\n\n【劇情】\nLuna的家鄉Cresfield市已經被Eternal所佔領，Eternal是一個信仰假神的武裝邪教。\nEternal試圖通過欺騙人們相信 \"永恆的幸福給所有人\" 來征服許多城鎮。\nLuna遇到了旅行者Dithen，僧Nack，學者Xavier，和喜劇演員Layzel，他們一起對抗Eternal。","publisher":"PLiCy","release":"2021-04-01","genres":["角色扮演","冒險","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.5GB / Switch 1.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e881f9c45e6588e27e8bb2522a8195bf9f3985a19c5c83f83ef92da070a4279.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/39784cda0578fc854be4202e52a32b9407972de46f0d0eb3280866f7cd895770.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3135a96328bf286b70452b5c79b5596fba1ef930aa20bc01560e8c8af59aaafa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8c8becd14fe20058c855df88b1b38280f0e2d3edbcca6b6ea39374ce9dd8cb52.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0463ee5f5497eecc56bdeea8b839ae5da5d3011b0f49ce386ce8501132735bee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/770798b8a16192121883328cbf5e65c0b69059e7666f731d7b7915a039b86b1c.jpg"],"titleId":"01005c2013b00000","dlc":[],"vids":["3ry02Ot9PHo"]}